this is a high level document describing the goals of this project

DO NOT MAKE AI EDITS TO THIS FILE

Maledictus is a replacement for nagini
 and does static type-checking

It needs to fill in the missing bits of nagini including:
 *js code
 *slices
 *callable-valued dataclasses


In addition, we should change it from scala to rust

requirements:
 *feature complete drop-in replacement for nagini
  (passes all nagini unit tests)
 *type system correctness formally proven (in lean)
 * static type analysis of systems containing both python and javascript
